# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file"). Save checks P5.3 and P5.4
# (port/test/README.md, "Save checks"; port/test/tools/savechk.sh). Hand-made from frame dumps
# of the played build, not from a TAS.
# Late-game save check, session 2 (and the P5.4-style cross-machine sessions). Start: late_iclear_k1.keys' end save (the post-game Tower of Valni floor 1, index 36, turn 1, suspended; slot 2's world map save). Resume Chapter, slot 2, resume; the cursor off Ephraim, A: the map menu, End: the enemy phase (the 17 monsters move; no battle on the played build), turn 2's player phase from about 2,950 (suspend saves); about 1,000 ticks of slack.
# 4000 ticks; each press is held 2 ticks. The played builds take it as FE8PC_KEYSCRIPT
# (port/test/tools/keys_to_keyscript.py; frame N is tick N on the lag-free PC).
#
000*250
001*2      # 250: A, health and safety
000*748
008*2      # 1000: Start, skip the opening
000*298
001*2      # 1300: A, title: the title menu (Resume Chapter)
000*198
001*2      # 1500: A, Resume Chapter: the slot list
000*198
001*2      # 1700: A, slot 2 (Creature Campaign): resume
000*198
040*2      # 1900: Up, the cursor off Ephraim to an empty square
000*98
001*2      # 2000: A, the map menu
000*98
040*2      # 2100: Up, wraps to End
000*98
001*2      # 2200: A, End: the enemy phase
000*1798
